l meals.\n\n5. **Impairment Rating** (when at MMI):\n- Use AMA Guides to the Evaluation of Permanent Impairment, 6th edition.\n- Rate bilateral upper extremity impairment (nerve injuries, ROM loss, grip strength loss).\n- Rate bilateral lower extremity impairment (plantar neuropathic pain).\n- Combine for whole-person impairment rating.',
